## Part 3: UI-UX metrics Layout, Calculator, & Iframe

We built and styled new functional layout components:
1. **Embedded Troubleshoot Game (Tab 2 — "2. H2: Text Complexity")**: Embedded the fermentation game simulator (running locally at `http://localhost:8501/`) inside a responsive iframe container. This allows the presenter to demonstrate the troubleshooting interface in real-time.
2. **Operational Labor Cost Calculator (Tab 4 — "4. Strategy Clusters")**: Added an interactive labor forecasting tool below Figure 2. It compares annual troubleshooting costs for "Copier" vs "Improver" profiles based on their actual telemetry durations, adjustable with rate and ticket sliders.

